<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN - 55,000 tonnes fertilisers Yuzhniyy/Bombay $21 fio 8,000 shex/2,500 shex 15-23/5 Seatrans.</p>
<p>Tal - 50,000 tonnes dap Pasacagoula/Bombay $26.50 fio 11-16/5 Indian government.</p>
<p>Saturn - 50,000 tonnes dap Pasacagoula or Tampa/Bombay $25 fio end May Indian government.</p>
<p>Maritime - 15,000 tonnes phosphate Tartous/India $25 fio 4,000/1,200 15-20/5 Indian government.</p>
<p>Wonder - 14,000 tonnes urea Ruwais/India $12.50 fio 4,500/1,200 14-19/5 Indian government.</p>
</text>
